    // line 25
    vela_builder_add(v_out, VELA_STR("`vela run FILE ARGS...` compiles and runs; `vela build FILE -o EXE` produces an executable; `vela test FILE [WORDS...]` runs matching test blocks including imported modules. `vela fmt -w FILE...` formats in place; `-l` lists unformatted files. `vela query type|def|refs|complete FILE:LINE:COL` answers about names; `vela query symbols FILE` lists declarations; `vela query unsafe FILE` audits wrappers and indirect/deferred unsafe paths, flagging unknown targets. `query summary FILE` gives API/effects/contracts; `query impact FILE[:LINE:COL]` gives conservative dependents; `query coverage TARGET` gives possible tests, or measured entries with `--report REPORT` after `vela test --coverage REPORT FILE`. `vela rename FILE:LINE:COL NEW` renames across modules. Positions count bytes from 1. `vela lsp` starts the editor server.\012", 830));
