    vela_builder_add(v_out, VELA_STR("`uses fs` covers files/directories; os covers process/environment/input; net covers networking; clock covers time. Effects propagate through calls/function values. Main/tests implicitly allow these; unsafe needs declaration/block. Printing/os.write are effect-free. `fn map[T, U](xs: [T], f: fn(T) -> U) -> [U] uses f` means the caller inherits the argument function's effects. An ordinary pure function parameter cannot be called with an effectful function.\012", 459));
